<p><em>With the Meditation Map of the Dhamma it is now even easier to share gems and find new places for exploring the Buddha’s theory and practice.</em></p>

<p>In the spirit of <em>one</em> Dhamma/Dharma, places from different traditions are included here. Some of the places give you an opportunity to practice meditation for an extensive period of time, perhaps even for years, on a donation basis. This is truly an amazing gift for those who want to go deeper in the Dhamma. It is also generosity and <em>dāna</em>-culture at its best. Please allow yourself to become a part of this generous spirit when you enter these communities, and try to find a way to give something back. Remember the preciousness of your stay, for yourself and for future meditators.</p>

<p>Share the map as you like. If you want to contribute a new place, give an update, or even write a review of a place on the list, please <a href="mailto:nibbidadhamma@gmail.com">write to me</a>.</p>

<p><em>May your practice be fruitful, wherever you go.</em></p>

<h2 id="open-the-map">Open the map</h2>
<p class="buttons"><a class="btn" href="{{ map.map_url }}">Open the map in Google Maps</a></p>
<p>The map is a saved list in Google Maps. It opens in the Google Maps app or website.</p>
<p>Images you can use to share the map online:
{%- for i in map.share_images %} <a href="{{ i.url }}">{{ i.label }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} and{% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>

<h2 id="a-few-well-known-places">A few well-known places</h2>
<div class="mapui" data-tiles="{{ map.tiles | dump }}">
<div class="cont-bar" role="group" aria-label="Show places by continent" hidden>
<button type="button" class="cont-btn" data-cont="all" aria-pressed="true">All places</button>
{%- for c in map.highlights | continents %}
<button type="button" class="cont-btn" data-cont="{{ c }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ c }}</button>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
<div class="map-panel" hidden>
<div class="map-start"><button type="button" class="map-show">Show the map</button><p>The map is drawn with OpenStreetMap. It loads only when you press the button.</p></div>
<div class="map-canvas" role="region" aria-label="Map of the places" hidden></div>
</div>
<p class="map-count" aria-live="polite"></p>
<ul class="places">
{%- for p in map.highlights %}
<li data-cont="{{ p.continent }}"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.name }}</a> <span>{{ p.region }}{% if p.website and p.website != p.url %} · <a href="{{ p.website }}">Website ↗</a>{% endif %}</span></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
<script type="application/json" class="map-data">{{ map.highlights | dump | safe }}</script>
</div>

<h2 id="other-maps-and-lists">Other maps and lists</h2>
<p>If you are interested in a particular group or school, you might want to look at some of these other, less inclusive maps and lists:</p>
<ul>
{%- for m in map.other_maps %}
<li><a href="{{ m.url }}">{{ m.name }}</a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

